docs/reviews\prework-arts-read-2026-11-19.md:422:| One culture's canon | Part | Rule is stated; no guard against the open sources' bias (finding 12). |
docs/reviews\prework-arts-read-2026-11-19.md:423:| A plan that needs a daily period | Part | K to 8 clear; high school levels 160 daily sessions with no short path (finding 17). |
docs/reviews\prework-arts-read-2026-11-19.md:425:### Shared core rows that point at layer 3, read against this page
docs/reviews\prework-arts-read-2026-11-19.md:429:| C1 Every standard named and taught in full; named edition loaded | Part | Edition named and loaded (STANDARD 1). Parts by verb impossible with no wording (1, 7); count table missing (2); music high school ids not loaded; no id-existence gate (3). |
docs/reviews\prework-arts-read-2026-11-19.md:433:| C5 Unit overview prepares the teacher | Fail | The page says what a unit carries, not that a teacher page teaches the teacher (a non-specialist; finding 15). |
docs/reviews\prework-arts-read-2026-11-19.md:435:| C7 Taught, then faded, and returns | Fail | No holder, no withdrawal day (finding 5). |
